<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board reported seven ships loading, 15 waiting and one due at the Canadian West Coast, as of Friday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load on the West Coast was 10 days. One ship loaded in Thunder Bay while four were due. Two ships waited on the East Coast while seven were due.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver	 6	    10</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert   1	     5</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
